{
 "source": "XPathEvaluator parses the body namespace-aware only when the matcher has namespacePrefixes (bound in its NamespaceContext; an unknown prefix resolves to no namespace); without them the DOM is namespace-unaware: namespace-uri() is empty, local-name() strips the prefix, a name test compares the qualified name, a prefixed name test is never true and an unbound prefix in the body is no error. A body that does not parse records the ErrorHandler's fatal error and then the thrown SAXParseException.",
